Pardon my saying so, but with only 26 hp you may as well have been attacking
the Wiz himself.  Be lucky you didn't run into an ochre jelly, or balrog, or
a mumakil.  These 3 have been known to lop off 50+ hp at a time.
Getting killed in one blow is a Certifiable Annoying Death.  My advice is to
attack by throwing weapons at it, get better AC, and/or more hp.  BTW, when
you hit a spotted jelly the acid damage is its level times d6.  Therefore it
must have been at least level 5.
